IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ppa-privileges`

-- Parliament (Privileges, Immunities and Powers) Act 1962, ss 5 to 11A, 13, 15 to 17, 20 to 22, 26, 29, 31, 35 to 37 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_parliament-privileges-immunities-and-powers-act-1962.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 5, 6, 20(2), (3)`

#ASSERT `the Member is immune from the proceedings` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `the Member is immune from the proceedings` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the Member is immune from the proceedings` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `the Member is immune from the proceedings` TRUE FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `the person acting for Parliament is protected` TRUE FALSE

